1
00:00:00,198 --> 00:00:03,798
(Leonard:)Happened to Einstein. He got stuck
in the unified field theory for decades.

2
00:00:03,968 --> 00:00:05,598
(Sheldon:)Oh, don't play the Einstein card.

3
00:00:05,770 --> 00:00:08,260
His breakthroughs happened
when no one knew anything.

4
00:00:08,439 --> 00:00:10,429
(Sheldon:)Everything was a great breakthrough.

5
00:00:10,775 --> 00:00:13,805
(Leonard:)Sheldon Lee Cooper,
I do not have time for this nonsense.

6
00:00:13,978 --> 00:00:16,968
(Leonard:)Go put your clothes on,
get in the car, and let's go to work.

7
00:00:17,915 --> 00:00:20,885
All right, jeez.

8
00:00:21,219 --> 00:00:22,279
(Sheldon:)What a grouch.

9
00:00:25,790 --> 00:00:28,730
(Leonard:)How did I do that?
I gotta remember how I did that.

10
00:00:31,095 --> 00:00:33,065
(Howard:)Do you realize by owning a 3D printer...

11
00:00:33,231 --> 00:00:35,791
(Howard:)...we are reclaiming
the manufacturing process...

12
00:00:35,967 --> 00:00:39,907
(Howard:)...and taking jobs back
from sweatshops in China.

13
00:00:40,638 --> 00:00:43,068
(Raj:)I think this thing was made in China.

14
00:00:44,275 --> 00:00:46,075
(Howard:)Eh, what can you do?

15
00:00:46,978 --> 00:00:49,508
Ooh, I think it's done.

16
00:00:51,349 --> 00:00:52,609
(Raj:)It worked.

17
00:00:52,984 --> 00:00:55,454
(Raj:)We printed a whistle.

18
00:00:56,754 --> 00:00:57,914
(Howard:)Amazing.

19
00:00:58,089 --> 00:01:01,179
(Howard:)You realize these things go
for 25 cents a pop at a party store.

